      },
      {
        "block_id": "PUjXdG1faoim6NxdHVhchCO4nvc",
        "block_type": 2,
        "parent_id": "K1cRdEcQSoAPIhxrag8c1C3Wnke",
        "text": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "With the addition of BYOC-I, Zilliz BYOC now provides two deployment options, namely the standard ",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "BYOC",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": true,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": " and ",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "BYOC-I",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": true,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": ". ",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": {
            "align": 1,
            "folded": false
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "block_id": "Q5RUdtwLLoAVLSxt8Yacm0Aantd",
        "block_type": 2,
        "parent_id": "K1cRdEcQSoAPIhxrag8c1C3Wnke",
        "text": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "Unlike the standard BYOC, which requires cross-account authorization, BYOC-I employs an agent deployed in the customer-managed VPC as the single point of contact between the control panel in Zilliz's VPC and the data plane in the customer-managed VPC.",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": {
            "align": 1,
            "folded": false
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "block_id": "RAKXdKGTjog9jexg1zWcXKa0nje",
        "block_type": 2,
        "parent_id": "K1cRdEcQSoAPIhxrag8c1C3Wnke",
        "text": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "Zilliz BYOC supports data governance and compliance across industries like finance, healthcare, resources, education, and e-commerce, all of which face stringent compliance requirements. For enterprises and organizations that require more stringent regulatory measures, BYOC-I is an ideal deployment option for achieving complete data sovereignty.",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": {
            "align": 1,
            "folded": false
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "block_id": "IlSkdxaImobfp9xS1p2c7MvknEd",
        "block_type": 2,
        "comment_ids": [
          "7486428196615962643"
        ],
        "parent_id": "K1cRdEcQSoAPIhxrag8c1C3Wnke",
        "text": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "This release also improves the management of projects deployed using the standard BYOC deployment option by adding ",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "Suspend",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": true,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": " and ",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "Resume",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": true,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": " functionalities. You can choose to pause the data plane and",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": " release the EC2 instances",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "comment_ids": [
                    "7486428196615962643"
                  ],
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": " associated with the EKS cluster to lower infrastructure costs and restore the data plane whenever you see fit.",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": {
            "align": 1,
            "folded": false
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "block_id": "UH9Gd8Ud7oPDmdxfGVAcPa2dnFh",
